### ti-knowledge-api — proxied through the gateway at /api/v1/knowledge/**
#
# /api/** requires an authenticated gateway session: log in via the browser at
# http://localhost:8080 (redirects through Okta), then copy the `SESSION` cookie
# value from dev tools into the Cookie header below. The gateway attaches its own
# OIDC id_token to the downstream call — a client Authorization header is ignored.

# Authorization: Bearer XXX


### List questions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/knowledge/questions
Accept: application/json
Cookie: SESSION=<SESSION_COOKIE_VALUE>

###


### List questions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/knowledge/questions
Accept: application/json
Cookie: SESSION=<SESSION_COOKIE_VALUE>

###


