###

### Number of questions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/knowledge/questions
Accept: application/json
Cookie: SESSION=<SESSION_COOKIE_VALUE>

###

### Get question by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/knowledge/questions/1
Accept: application/json
Cookie: SESSION=<SESSION_COOKIE_VALUE>

###

### Create question
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/knowledge/questions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Cookie: SESSION=<SESSION_COOKIE_VALUE>

{
  "question": "What is durability?",
  "shortAnswer": "Durability ensures that changes applied by a committed transaction survive system failures.",
  "detailedAnswer": "It is one of the ACID properties, typically implemented via write-ahead logging.",
  "questionLevelId": 1,
  "codeExample": {
    "language": "JAVA",
    "sourceCode": "connection.commit();"
  },
  "tagIds": [17],
  "projectIds": [],
  "resources": []
}

###

### Update question
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/knowledge/questions/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Cookie: SESSION=<SESSION_COOKIE_VALUE>

{
  "id": 1,
  "question": "What is durability? (updated)",
  "shortAnswer": "Durability guarantees committed changes survive crashes.",
  "detailedAnswer": "Implemented via write-ahead logging and checkpointing.",
  "questionLevel": { "questionLevelId": 1, "difficultyCode": "EASY" },
  "tags": [{ "id": 17, "tag": "transactions" }],
  "resources": [],
  "projects": []
}

###

### Delete question
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/knowledge/questions/1
Cookie: SESSION=<SESSION_COOKIE_VALUE>

###

### List projects
# response:
# [{"id": 1, "name": "Knowledge Platform"}, {"id": 2, "name": "Interview Preparation App"}]
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/knowledge/projects
Accept: application/json
Cookie: SESSION=<SESSION_COOKIE_VALUE>

###

### projects count
# example:
# 5
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/knowledge/projects/count
Cookie: SESSION=<SESSION_COOKIE_VALUE>

###

### projects count
# example:
# 5
GET http://localhost:8080/rest/v1/knowledge/projects/count
Cookie: SESSION=<SESSION_COOKIE_VALUE>

###

### List tags
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/knowledge/tags
Accept: application/json
Cookie: SESSION=<SESSION_COOKIE_VALUE>

###

### List question levels
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/knowledge/qlevels
Accept: application/json
Cookie: SESSION=<SESSION_COOKIE_VALUE>

